#: ../../export/content/applications/studio/fields.rst:306
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Image`: users can upload an image file, which is then displayed "
"in :ref:`Form view <studio/views/general/form>`. This has the same effect as"
" using the :ref:`Image field <studio/fields/simple-fields-image>`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`圖片`：用戶可上載圖片檔案，該圖片隨後會在:ref:`表單視圖 <studio/"
"views/general/form>`中顯示。這與使用:ref:`圖片欄位 <studio/fields/simple-"
"fields-image>`的效果相同。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/studio/fields.rst:309
msgid ""
":guilabel:`PDF Viewer`: users can upload a PDF file, which can be then "
"browsed from the :ref:`Form view <studio/views/general/form>`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`PDF 檢視器`：用戶可上載 PDF 檔案，然後在:ref:`表單視圖 <studio/"
"views/general/form>`中瀏覽該檔案。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/studio/fields.rst:314
msgid "Examples of File fields with different widgets"
msgstr "使用不同小工具的檔案欄位範例"

#: ../../export/content/applications/studio/fields.rst:320
msgid "Image (`image`)"
msgstr "圖片（`image`）"

#: ../../export/content/applications/studio/fields.rst:322
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Image` field is used to upload an image and display it in "
":ref:`Form view <studio/views/general/form>`. This field type is a "
":ref:`File field <studio/fields/simple-fields-file>` with the "
":guilabel:`Image` widget selected by default. Consequently, the "
":guilabel:`File` and :guilabel:`PDF Viewer` widgets have the same effects as"
" described under :ref:`File <studio/fields/simple-fields-file>`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/studio/fields.rst:329
msgid ""
"To change the display size of uploaded images, select :guilabel:`Small`, "
":guilabel:`Medium`, or :guilabel:`Large` under the :guilabel:`Size` option."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/studio/fields.rst:335
msgid "Priority (`selection`)"
msgstr "優先次序（`selection`）"

#: ../../export/content/applications/studio/fields.rst:337
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Priority` field is used to display a three-star rating "
"system, which can be used to indicate importance or satisfaction level. This"
" field type is a :ref:`Selection field <studio/fields/simple-fields-"
"selection>` with the :guilabel:`Priority` widget selected by default and "
"four priority values predefined. Consequently, the :guilabel:`Badge`, "
":guilabel:`Badges`, :guilabel:`Radio`, and :guilabel:`Selection` widgets "
"have the same effects as described under :ref:`Selection "
"<studio/fields/simple-fields-selection>`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/studio/fields.rst:345
msgid ""
"To change the number of available stars by adding or removing values, click "
":guilabel:`Edit Values`. Note that the first value is equal to 0 stars "
"(i.e., when no selection is made), so having four values results in a three-"
"star rating system, for example."
msgstr ""
"若要透過新增或移除數值來更改可用的星號數量，請點擊 :guilabel:`編輯值`。請注意"
"，第一個數值代表 0 顆星（即未作任何選擇），因此例如有四個數值時，便會構成三星"
"評分系統。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/studio/fields.rst:351
msgid "Example of a Priority field"
msgstr "優先級欄位範例"

#: ../../export/content/applications/studio/fields.rst:357
msgid "Signature (`signature`)"
msgstr "簽名（`signature`）"

#: ../../export/content/applications/studio/fields.rst:359
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Signature` field is used to sign the form electronically. "
"This field type is a :ref:`File field <studio/fields/simple-fields-file>` "
"with the :guilabel:`Signature` widget selected by default. Consequently, the"
" :guilabel:`File`, :guilabel:`Image`, and :guilabel:`PDF Viewer` widgets "
"have the same effects as described under :ref:`File <studio/fields/simple-"
"fields-file>`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/studio/fields.rst:365
msgid ""
"To give users the :guilabel:`Auto` option when having to draw their "
"signature, select one of the available :guilabel:`Prefill with` fields "
"(:ref:`Many2One <studio/fields/relational-fields-many2one>`, and "
":ref:`Related Field <studio/fields/relational-fields-related-field>` on the "
"model only). The signature is then automatically generated using the data "
"from the selected field."
msgstr ""
"若要讓使用者在需要繪製簽名時可使用 :guilabel:`自動` 選項，請選取其中一個可用"
"的 :guilabel:`預先填入` 欄位（僅限模型上的 :ref:`Many2One <studio/fields/"
"relational-fields-many2one>` 及 :ref:`相關欄位 <studio/fields/relational-"
"fields-related-field>`）。系統隨後會使用所選欄位的資料自動產生簽名。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/studio/fields.rst:373
msgid "Example of a Signature field"
msgstr ""

