"視。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/studio/fields.rst:542
msgid ""
"In the :icon:`add` :guilabel:`Add` tab, drag the relevant :ref:`field type "
"<studio/fields/field-types>` from the :guilabel:`New Fields` section and "
"drop it in the desired position. If the new field is a :ref:`relational "
