"field, model, or related field in the pop-up."
msgstr ""
"在 :icon:`add` :guilabel:`新增` 分頁中，將所需的:ref:`欄位類型 <studio/"
"fields/field-types>`從:guilabel:`新欄位`區段拖放至所需位置。如果新欄位"
"是:ref:`關聯欄位 <studio/fields/relational-fields>`，請在彈出式視窗中選擇相關"
"的對應欄位、模型或關聯欄位。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/studio/fields.rst:547
msgid ""
"In the :icon:`dns` :guilabel:`Properties` tab, configure the field's "
":ref:`properties <studio/fields/properties>`:"
