#: ../../export/content/applications/studio/fields.rst:583
msgid ""
"In the :icon:`add` :guilabel:`Add` tab, in the left panel, click "
":guilabel:`Existing Fields` :icon:`arrow_right` to reveal a list of all the "
"model's fields that are not currently present in the view."
msgstr ""
"在左側面板的 :icon:`add` :guilabel:`新增` 分頁中，按一下 :guilabel:`現有欄"
"位` :icon:`arrow_right`，即可顯示目前尚未出現在該視圖中的所有模型欄位清單。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/studio/fields.rst:586
msgid "Drag the relevant field and drop it in the desired position."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/studio/fields.rst:587
msgid ""
"In the :icon:`dns` :guilabel:`Properties` tab, configure the relevant "
":ref:`properties <studio/fields/properties>` for the field in the current "
"view."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/studio/fields.rst:591
msgid ""
"Various properties can be configured independently for different views, if "
"needed, such as the :guilabel:`Label`, the :guilabel:`Widget`, the "
"visibility of the field for certain user groups, as well as whether or not "
"the field is :guilabel:`Invisible`, :guilabel:`Required`, or "
":guilabel:`Readonly`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/studio/fields.rst:601
msgid "Field properties"
msgstr "欄位屬性"

#: ../../export/content/applications/studio/fields.rst:603
msgid ""
"A series of :ref:`general properties <studio/fields/properties-general>` can"
" be configured for most combinations of :ref:`field type and widget "
"<studio/fields/field-types>`. Additional properties are available depending "
"on the specific field type and widget selected. For example, various "
":ref:`specific properties <studio/fields/properties-date-datetime>` can be "
"configured for :guilabel:`Date` and :guilabel:`Datetime` fields."
msgstr ""
"可設定一系列:ref:`一般屬性 <studio/fields/properties-general>`，適用於大多"
"數:ref:`欄位類型與小工具 <studio/fields/field-types>`組合。視乎所選的特定欄位"
"類型及小工具而定，系統亦會提供其他屬性。例如，有各種:ref:`特定屬性 <studio/"
"fields/properties-date-datetime>`可供設定，適用於:guilabel:`日"
"期`及:guilabel:`日期時間`欄位。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/studio/fields.rst:613
msgid "General properties"
msgstr "一般屬性"

#: ../../export/content/applications/studio/fields.rst:615
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Class`: Use `Bootstrap "
"<https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.3/examples/cheatsheet/>`_ or other custom "
"classes defined in Odoo to customize how the field is styled and displayed "
"on the UI."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/studio/fields.rst:618
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Invisible`: Enable this property when it is not necessary for "
"users to view a field on the UI. This helps declutter the UI by only showing"
" the essential fields depending on a specific situation."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/studio/fields.rst:622
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Required`: Enable this property if a field should always be "
"completed by the user before being able to proceed."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/studio/fields.rst:625
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Readonly`: Enable this property if users should not be able to "
"modify a field."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/studio/fields.rst:628
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Invisible` property also applies inside Studio. To view "
"hidden fields in Studio, click on a view's :icon:`tv` :guilabel:`View` tab "
"and enable :guilabel:`Show Invisible Elements`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/studio/fields.rst:631
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Invisible`, :guilabel:`Required`, and :guilabel:`Readonly` "
"properties can be enabled for specific records only by clicking on "
":guilabel:`Conditional` and creating a filter."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/studio/fields.rst:635
msgid ""
"On the form view of the *Contact* model, the :guilabel:`Title` field only "
"appears when :guilabel:`Individual` is selected, as that field would not be "
"helpful for a :guilabel:`Company` contact."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/studio/fields.rst:639
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Label`: This is the field name on the UI; the label is used to "
"generate the technical name of the field."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/studio/fields.rst:642
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Help Tooltip`: To explain the purpose of a field, add a "
"description. The text is displayed inside a tooltip box when hovering with "
"your mouse over the question mark beside the field's label."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/studio/fields.rst:646
msgid ""
":guilabel:`AI Autofill`: Enable this option to add AI capabilities allowing "
"the value of the field to be generated automatically through a prompt. When "
"the browser page reloads, click :guilabel:`Set prompt`, then enter the "
"prompt; type `/` to open the :guilabel:`AI prompt tools` and use the "
":guilabel:`Field Selector` to tell Odoo AI which fields to check for "
"context. Click :guilabel:`Save`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`AI 自動填寫`：啟用此選項即可加入 AI 功能，透過提示詞自動生成欄位值"
"。當瀏覽器頁面重新載入後，點擊:guilabel:`設定提示詞`，然後輸入提示詞；輸入 `/"
"` 以開啟:guilabel:`AI 提示詞工具`，並使用:guilabel:`欄位選擇器`告知 Odoo AI "
"要檢查哪些欄位以獲取上下文資料。最後點擊:guilabel:`儲存`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/studio/fields.rst:652
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Track in chatter`: Enable this option to track changes to the "
"field in the record's chatter."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/studio/fields.rst:655
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Technical Name`: To view the field's technical name in Studio "
"(and, during the configuration of a new field, edit it if desired), activate"
" :ref:`developer mode <developer-mode>`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/studio/fields.rst:660
msgid ""
"If the technical name needs to be updated but is no longer editable via "
"Studio, it can be :ref:`modified via the technical settings of the database "
"<studio/fields/properties-technical-name-change>`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/studio/fields.rst:664
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Widget`: To change the default appearance or functionality of a "
"field, select one of the available widgets."
msgstr ":guilabel:`小工具`：要變更欄位的預設外觀或功能，請選擇其中一個可用的小工具。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/studio/fields.rst:667
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Placeholder`: To provide an example of how a field should be "
"completed, add a fixed placeholder text. This text appears in light gray "
"until a value is entered."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`佔位文字`：如需提供填寫欄位的範例，請新增固定的佔位提示文字。在輸"
"入數值前，該文字會以淺灰色顯示。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/studio/fields.rst:670
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Dynamic Placeholder`: To provide the value of the selected field "
"as an example of how a field should be completed. This text appears in light"
" gray until a value is entered."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/studio/fields.rst:673
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Default value`: To display a default value in a field when a "
"record is created, enter a value."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/studio/fields.rst:676
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Allow visibility to groups`: To limit which users can view the "
"field, select one or more user access :ref:`groups <access-rights/groups>`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`允許對群組可見`：如要限制可檢視該欄位的用戶，請選擇一個或多個用戶"
"存取權限:ref:`群組 <access-rights/groups>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/studio/fields.rst:679
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Forbid visibility to groups`: To prevent certain users from "
"seeing the field, select one or more user access :ref:`groups <access-"
"rights/groups>`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/studio/fields.rst:685
msgid "Properties for Date and Datetime fields"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/studio/fields.rst:687
msgid ""
"For :guilabel:`Date` fields using the :guilabel:`Date` or :guilabel:`Date "
"Range` widget and :guilabel:`Datetime` fields using the :guilabel:`Date & "
"Time` or :guilabel:`Date Range` widget, some specific properties are "
"available:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/studio/fields.rst:691
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Minimal precision`: Determine the smallest date unit that must be"
" selected in the date picker. The possible values are `Days`, `Decades`, "
"`Months` and `Years`. If no value is selected, the user must select a day in"
" the date picker."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`最小精確度`：決定在日期選擇器中必須選取的最小日期單位。可用值為 "
"`日`、`十年`、`月` 及 `年`。如果未選取任何值，使用者必須在日期選擇器中選取日"
"。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/studio/fields.rst:694
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Maximal precision`: Determine the largest date unit that can be "
"used to navigate the date picker. The possible values are `Days`, `Decades`,"
" `Months` and `Years`. If no value is selected, the user can navigate the "
"date picker by decade."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/studio/fields.rst:697
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Date format`: By default the date will be shown as e.g., `Jan 31,"
" 2026` (or the equivalent for the user's language/regional settings). Select"
" the all-numeric date format, e.g., 31/01/2026, if desired."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/studio/fields.rst:700
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Warning`: Add a warning if a future or past date is selected. The"
" possible values are :guilabel:`No warning`, :guilabel:`Future date`, or "
":guilabel:`Past date`. If the user enters a future or past date when the "
"expected date is either today's date or a date in the past or future, "
"respectively, the entered date appears in red."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`警告`：如選擇未來或過去的日期，便會加入警告。可選數值包"
"括:guilabel:`無警告`、:guilabel:`未來日期`或:guilabel:`過去日期`。若預期日期"
"分別為今天、過去日期或未來日期，而用戶輸入未來或過去的日期，輸入的日期便會以"
"紅色顯示。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/studio/fields.rst:704
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Earliest accepted date`: Enter the earliest date that can be "
"selected in the date picker in ISO format, i.e., `YYYY-MM-DD`. If the "
"current date is always the earliest accepted date, enter `today`. On the "
"date picker, dates prior to the earliest accepted date are grayed out."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`最早可接受日期`：以 ISO 格式（即 `YYYY-MM-DD`）輸入日期選擇器中可"
"選擇的最早日期。如果目前日期始終為最早可接受日期，請輸入 `today`。在日期選擇"
"器上，早於最早可接受日期的日期將會呈灰色顯示。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/studio/fields.rst:708
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Latest accepted date`: Enter the latest date that can be selected"
" in the date picker in ISO format, i.e., `YYYY-MM-DD`. If the current date "
"is always the latest accepted date, enter `today`. On the date picker, dates"
" later than the latest accepted date are grayed out."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/studio/fields.rst:713
msgid ""
"For :guilabel:`Date` or :guilabel:`Datetime` fields using the "
":guilabel:`Date Range` widget, additional properties are available:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/studio/fields.rst:716
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Start date field` and :guilabel:`End date field`: These "
"properties are used to define a start or end date for a :ref:`date range or "
"date and time range <studio/fields/simple-fields-date-time-range>`; only one"
" of these properties can be populated."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/studio/fields.rst:719
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Show time`: This property is *enabled* by default. Disable the "
"property to show only the date in a :guilabel:`Datetime` field."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/studio/fields.rst:721
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Show seconds`: This property is *disabled* by default. Enable the"
" property to show the seconds in a :guilabel:`Datetime` field."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`顯示秒數`：此屬性預設為 *停用*。啟用此屬性即可在 :guilabel:`日期時"
"間` 欄位中顯示秒數。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/studio/fields.rst:723
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Always range`: Enable this option to always display an input "
"field for both a start and end date. If left disabled, the date or date and "
"time picker allows the user to choose to enter a single :guilabel:`Date` "
"(i.e., a date or date and time, depending on the field type) by default, or "
"to click :guilabel:`Range` to enter a date range or date and time range, as "
"relevant."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/studio/fields.rst:727
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Time interval`: Enter a value to determine the minute intervals "
"shown in the time picker of a :guilabel:`Datetime` field. For example, enter"
" 15 to allow quarter-hour intervals. The default value is set to `5` "
"(minutes)."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`時間間隔`：輸入數值以決定:guilabel:`日期時間`欄位時間選擇器中顯示"
"的分鐘間隔。例如，輸入 15 可設定為每刻鐘間隔。預設值為 `5`（分鐘）。"

