#: ../../export/content/applications/studio/views.rst:3
msgid "Views"
msgstr "檢視"

#: ../../export/content/applications/studio/views.rst:5
msgid ""
"Views are the interface that allows displaying the data contained in a "
":doc:`model <models_modules_apps>`. One model can have several views, which "
"are simply different ways to show the same data. In Studio, views are "
"organized into four categories: :ref:`general <studio/views/general>`, "
":ref:`multiple records <studio/views/multiple-records>`, :ref:`timeline "
"<studio/views/timeline>`, and :ref:`reporting <studio/views/reporting>`."
msgstr ""
"檢視是用於顯示 :doc:`模型 <models_modules_apps>` 中所含資料的介面。一個模型可"
"以有多個檢視，這只是顯示相同資料的不同方式。在 Studio 中，檢視分為四個類別"
"：:ref:`一般 <studio/views/general>`、:ref:`多項紀錄 <studio/views/multiple-"
"records>`、:ref:`時間軸 <studio/views/timeline>` 及 :ref:`報表 <studio/views/"
"reporting>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/studio/views.rst:12
msgid ""
"To change the default view of a model, :ref:`access Studio <studio/access>`,"
" go to :guilabel:`Views`, click the :icon:`fa-ellipsis-v` "
"(:guilabel:`ellipsis`) icon next to the desired view, and click "
":guilabel:`Set As Default`."
msgstr ""
"要變更模型的預設檢視，請 :ref:`存取 Studio <studio/access>`，前往 "
":guilabel:`檢視`，按一下所需檢視旁的 :icon:`fa-ellipsis-v`（:guilabel:`省略符"
"號`）圖示，然後按一下 :guilabel:`設為預設`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/studio/views.rst:15
msgid ""
"Views can also be modified using Studio's built-in XML editor. To do so, "
":ref:`activate developer mode <developer-mode>`, navigate to the relevant "
"view, select the :guilabel:`View` tab, then click :guilabel:`</> XML`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/studio/views.rst:20
msgid ""
"When editing a view using the XML editor, avoid making changes directly to "
"standard and inherited views, as these would be reset and lost during "
"updates or module upgrades. Always make sure to select the correct Studio "
"inherited views: when a view is modified in Studio by dragging and dropping "
"a new field, for example, a specific Studio inherited view and its "
"corresponding XPath, which defines the modified part of the view, are "
"automatically generated."
